Hello <%= @invitee.name.presence || @invitee.email %>,

This event has been updated. Please re-confirm your attendance.
Updated: <%= @event.title %>

Date: <%= @event_date %>
Time: <%= @event_time %>
Organizer: <%= @host.full_name.presence || @host.email %>
Location: <%= @event.location.presence || @meeting_link || "Online" %>
Description: <%= @event.description.presence || "No description provided" %>

<% if @change_summary.present? %>
What's changed:
<% @change_summary.each do |field, diff| %>
- <%= field.to_s.humanize %>: <%= diff["from"].presence || "(empty)" %> -> <%= diff["to"].presence || "(empty)" %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

Accept: <%= @accept_url %>
Decline: <%= @decline_url %>
Maybe: <%= @maybe_url %>

<% if @unregistered_invitee %>
You can review and respond to this event update without logging in.
View invitation: <%= @view_invite_url %>
Optional signup: <%= @signup_url %>
<% end %>
